{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to be a bed? An apple? Or a flower?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait no longer; here comes Henry! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058140/extras/c8be2483d1321b6aaf73362baef06619.avif?t=1758563288\" width=600 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Henry Halfhead is a quirky sandbox adventure game about an odd little character with the ability to become any object within their reach. Discover every object's unique properties and abilities and cleverly combine them to take Henry through their not-so-ordinary everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058140/extras/8b31768f1a02d2cc59069becb553918b.poster.avif?t=1758563288\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058140/extras/8b31768f1a02d2cc59069becb553918b.webm?t=1758563288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058140/extras/8b31768f1a02d2cc59069becb553918b.mp4?t=1758563288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>PLAY AS 250+ DIFFERENT OBJECTS</strong><br>Become a knife to slice your morning toast, water your beloved plants as a watering can or fold yourself into a paper plane to take off. Unlock new rooms and objects as you solve challenges, growing a joyful playground. Explore each level to find alternative solutions, funky hats and additional story bits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A WHOLESOME STORY</strong> <br>Play through a wholesome story, humorously told by a narrator who will react to your mischief. Help Henry stay playful and curious as you accompany them through the different stages of life. Experiment, explore and make everyday life fun again! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>LOCAL CO-OP</strong>  <br>Experience the game with a friend in the local co-op mode. Collaboratively solve challenges or have fun inducing chaos together!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"They grow up so fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058140/fc3c2b2c9da9585a2e51f3e0c9dfcb7cf9bde9e0.jpg"},{"name":"Grade A Student","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058140/63cfe7a19350ac28bf89a291a30abd0706326d96.jpg"},{"name":"A new Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058140/7d80b574afd305e92c71e62978f3209ee84ec0a9.jpg"},{"name":"Rediscovered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058140/f51073fd3f90864566cc05aefe91b208f7a77aa2.jpg"},{"name":"What a Life!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058140/00ee743f8223d98994d73d6184f8e5c60373fc17.jpg"},{"name":"Swimming Buddy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058140/507ce31ea04b4b82c182a376f36199f7a774a98a.jpg"},{"name":"Beans for Breakfast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058140/80d0c27e5d3455accac69a278f67015d444631c6.jpg"},{"name":"Employee of the Month","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058140/32c630871db33df9e46ec24c3af73575f584d238.jpg"},{"name":"Back on Schedule","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058140/10c33ead23a2f5908277b72af12119ad5361796a.jpg"},{"name":"Delicious Treat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2